    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "The quiet sounds nice, I guess. But there's a difference between a peaceful descent and just... fading. Watching the skill slip away, the mind getting foggy, the body failing. It feels like a slow, messy tragedy. I always imagined a life ending with purpose, not just a long, slow erosion of everything I worked for.",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
