      "content": "It's hard to embrace the fog when it feels so undignified. I see so many people just... lingering, becoming ghosts of themselves, losing the very thing that made them who they were. I've always believed that there's a certain grace in knowing when the story is complete. Why should I wait for the decay to take everything if the masterpiece is already finished?",
